WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:07.269
ReachConvert turns a list of leads into personalised emails and AI phone calls, all from one workspace.

00:08.670 --> 00:15.446
Start by importing your leads into a directory. Upload a CSV or a spreadsheet, and map the columns.

00:16.050 --> 00:24.989
In MailReach, name your campaign, then pick a saved template, or have AI write one. First name and company are filled in for every recipient.

00:28.100 --> 00:34.438
Choose who to send to, and launch. The emails go out through your own Amazon SES account.

00:38.050 --> 00:42.425
Every recipient is tracked, with delivery, opens and replies.

00:44.860 --> 00:51.842
Next, your calling agent. It speaks with a Gemini Live voice, and answers from your own knowledge base.

00:52.440 --> 00:58.238
In VoiceReach, describe the calls you want, and the copilot drafts the agent's objective and script.

01:05.750 --> 01:09.321
Pick the agent, choose who to call, and start the dialer.

01:14.400 --> 01:19.602
Each call is logged with its outcome, duration and recording.

01:20.660 --> 01:25.037
And every email and every call lands on one dashboard.

01:27.200 --> 01:38.462
ReachConvert is free and self-hosted. Bring your own keys, and start reaching out. This demo used sample data, with simulated email delivery and calls.
